[
  {
    "content_id": "10008001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;当士师秉政的时候，国中遭遇饥荒。在犹大的伯利恒，有一个人带着妻子和两个儿子往摩押地去寄居。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这人名叫以利米勒，他的妻名叫拿俄米；他两个儿子，一个名叫玛伦，一个名叫基连，都是犹大伯利恒的以法他人。他们到了摩押地，就住在那里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;后来拿俄米的丈夫以利米勒死了，剩下妇人和她两个儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;这两个儿子娶了摩押女子为妻，一个名叫俄珥巴，一个名叫路得，在那里住了约有十年。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;玛伦和基连二人也死了，剩下拿俄米，没有丈夫，也没有儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;她就与两个儿妇起身，要从摩押地归回；因为她在摩押地听见耶和华眷顾自己的百姓，赐粮食与他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;于是她和两个儿妇起行离开所住的地方，要回犹大地去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对两个儿妇说：「你们各人回娘家去吧。愿耶和华恩待你们，像你们恩待已死的人与我一样！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;愿耶和华使你们各在新夫家中得平安！」于是拿俄米与她们亲嘴。她们就放声而哭，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;说：「不然，我们必与你一同回你本国去。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米说：「我女儿们哪，回去吧！为何要跟我去呢？我还能生子作你们的丈夫吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我女儿们哪，回去吧！我年纪老迈，不能再有丈夫；即或说，我还有指望，今夜有丈夫可以生子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们岂能等着他们长大呢？你们岂能等着他们不嫁别人呢？我女儿们哪，不要这样。我为你们的缘故甚是愁苦，因为耶和华伸手攻击我。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;两个儿妇又放声而哭，俄珥巴与婆婆亲嘴而别，只是路得舍不得拿俄米。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米说：「看哪，你嫂子已经回她本国和她所拜的神那里去了，你也跟着你嫂子回去吧！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;路得说：「不要催我回去不跟随你。你往哪里去，我也往那里去；你在哪里住宿，我也在那里住宿；你的国就是我的国，你的　神就是我的　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你在哪里死，我也在那里死，也葬在那里。除非死能使你我相离！不然，愿耶和华重重地降罚与我。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米见路得定意要跟随自己去，就不再劝她了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;于是二人同行，来到伯利恒。她们到了伯利恒，合城的人就都惊讶。妇女们说：「这是拿俄米吗？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对她们说：「不要叫我拿俄米，要叫我玛拉，因为全能者使我受了大苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我满满地出去，耶和华使我空空地回来。耶和华降祸与我；全能者使我受苦。既是这样，你们为何还叫我拿俄米呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米和她儿妇摩押女子路得，从摩押地回来到伯利恒，正是动手割大麦的时候。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米的丈夫以利米勒的亲族中，有一个人名叫波阿斯，是个大财主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;摩押女子路得对拿俄米说：「容我往田间去，我蒙谁的恩，就在谁的身后拾取麦穗。」拿俄米说：「女儿啊，你只管去。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;路得就去了，来到田间，在收割的人身后拾取麦穗。她恰巧到了以利米勒本族的人波阿斯那块田里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯正从伯利恒来，对收割的人说：「愿耶和华与你们同在！」他们回答说：「愿耶和华赐福与你！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯问监管收割的仆人说：「那是谁家的女子？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;监管收割的仆人回答说：「是那摩押女子，跟随拿俄米从摩押地回来的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;她说：『请你容我跟着收割的人拾取打捆剩下的麦穗。』她从早晨直到如今，除了在屋子里坐一会儿，常在这里。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯对路得说：「女儿啊，听我说，不要往别人田里拾取麦穗，也不要离开这里，要常与我使女们在一处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的仆人在那块田收割，你就跟着他们去。我已经吩咐仆人不可欺负你；你若渴了，就可以到器皿那里喝仆人打来的水。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;路得就俯伏在地叩拜，对他说：「我既是外邦人，怎么蒙你的恩，这样顾恤我呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯回答说：「自从你丈夫死后，凡你向婆婆所行的，并你离开父母和本地，到素不认识的民中，这些事人全都告诉我了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;愿耶和华照你所行的赏赐你。你来投靠耶和华—以色列　神的翅膀下，愿你满得他的赏赐。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;路得说：「我主啊，愿在你眼前蒙恩。我虽然不及你的一个使女，你还用慈爱的话安慰我的心。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;到了吃饭的时候，波阿斯对路得说：「你到这里来吃饼，将饼蘸在醋里。」路得就在收割的人旁边坐下；他们把烘了的穗子递给她。她吃饱了，还有余剩的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;她起来又拾取麦穗，波阿斯吩咐仆人说：「她就是在捆中拾取麦穗，也可以容她，不可羞辱她；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;并要从捆里抽出些来，留在地下任她拾取，不可叱吓她。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;这样，路得在田间拾取麦穗，直到晚上，将所拾取的打了，约有一伊法大麦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;她就把所拾取的带进城去给婆婆看，又把她吃饱了所剩的给了婆婆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;婆婆问她说：「你今日在哪里拾取麦穗，在哪里做工呢？愿那顾恤你的得福。」路得就告诉婆婆说：「我今日在一个名叫波阿斯的人那里做工。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对儿妇说：「愿那人蒙耶和华赐福，因为他不断地恩待活人死人。」拿俄米又说：「那是我们本族的人，是一个至近的亲属。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;摩押女子路得说：「他对我说：『你要紧随我的仆人拾取麦穗，直等他们收完了我的庄稼。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对儿妇路得说：「女儿啊，你跟着他的使女出去，不叫人遇见你在别人田间，这才为好。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;于是路得与波阿斯的使女常在一处拾取麦穗，直到收完了大麦和小麦。路得仍与婆婆同住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;路得的婆婆拿俄米对她说：「女儿啊，我不当为你找个安身之处，使你享福吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你与波阿斯的使女常在一处，波阿斯不是我们的亲族吗？他今夜在场上簸大麦；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你要沐浴抹膏，换上衣服，下到场上，却不要使那人认出你来。你等他吃喝完了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;到他睡的时候，你看准他睡的地方，就进去掀开他脚上的被，躺卧在那里，他必告诉你所当做的事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;路得说：「凡你所吩咐的，我必遵行。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;路得就下到场上，照她婆婆所吩咐她的而行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯吃喝完了，心里欢畅，就去睡在麦堆旁边。路得便悄悄地来掀开他脚上的被，躺卧在那里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;到了夜半，那人忽然惊醒，翻过身来，不料有女子躺在他的脚下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他就说：「你是谁？」回答说：「我是你的婢女路得。求你用你的衣襟遮盖我，因为你是我一个至近的亲属。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯说：「女儿啊，愿你蒙耶和华赐福。你末后的恩比先前更大；因为少年人无论贫富，你都没有跟从。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;女儿啊，现在不要惧怕，凡你所说的，我必照着行；我本城的人都知道你是个贤德的女子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我实在是你一个至近的亲属，只是还有一个人比我更近。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你今夜在这里住宿，明早他若肯为你尽亲属的本分，就由他吧！倘若不肯，我指着永生的耶和华起誓，我必为你尽了本分，你只管躺到天亮。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;路得便在他脚下躺到天快亮，人彼此不能辨认的时候就起来了。波阿斯说：「不可使人知道有女子到场上来」；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;又对路得说：「打开你所披的外衣。」她打开了，波阿斯就撮了六簸箕大麦，帮她扛在肩上，她便进城去了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;路得回到婆婆那里，婆婆说：「女儿啊，怎么样了？」路得就将那人向她所行的述说了一遍，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;又说：「那人给了我六簸箕大麦，对我说：『你不可空手回去见你的婆婆。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;婆婆说：「女儿啊，你只管安坐等候，看这事怎样成就，因为那人今日不办成这事必不休息。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯到了城门，坐在那里，恰巧波阿斯所说的那至近的亲属经过。波阿斯说：「某人哪，你来坐在这里。」他就来坐下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯又从本城的长老中拣选了十人，对他们说：「请你们坐在这里。」他们就都坐下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯对那至近的亲属说：「从摩押地回来的拿俄米，现在要卖我们族兄以利米勒的那块地；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我想当赎那块地的是你，其次是我，以外再没有别人了。你可以在这里的人面前和我本国的长老面前说明，你若肯赎就赎，若不肯赎就告诉我。」那人回答说：「我肯赎。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯说：「你从拿俄米手中买这地的时候，也当娶死人的妻摩押女子路得，使死人在产业上存留他的名。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那人说：「这样我就不能赎了，恐怕于我的产业有碍。你可以赎我所当赎的，我不能赎了。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;从前，在以色列中要定夺什么事，或赎回，或交易，这人就脱鞋给那人。以色列人都以此为证据。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那人对波阿斯说：「你自己买吧！」于是将鞋脱下来了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯对长老和众民说：「你们今日作见证，凡属以利米勒和基连、玛伦的，我都从拿俄米手中置买了；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;又娶了玛伦的妻摩押女子路得为妻，好在死人的产业上存留他的名，免得他的名在本族本乡灭没。你们今日可以作见证。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;在城门坐着的众民和长老都说：「我们作见证。愿耶和华使进你家的这女子，像建立以色列家的拉结、利亚二人一样。又愿你在以法他得亨通，在伯利恒得名声。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;愿耶和华从这少年女子赐你后裔，使你的家像她玛从犹大所生法勒斯的家一般。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;于是，波阿斯娶了路得为妻，与她同房。耶和华使她怀孕生了一个儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;妇人们对拿俄米说：「耶和华是应当称颂的！因为今日没有撇下你，使你无至近的亲属。愿这孩子在以色列中得名声。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他必提起你的精神，奉养你的老，因为是爱慕你的那儿妇所生的。有这儿妇比有七个儿子还好！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米就把孩子抱在怀中，作他的养母。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;邻舍的妇人说：「拿俄米得孩子了！」就给孩子起名叫俄备得。这俄备得是耶西的父，耶西是大卫的父。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;法勒斯的后代记在下面：法勒斯生希斯 ；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;希斯 生兰；兰生亚米拿达；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;亚米拿达生拿顺；拿顺生撒门；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;撒门生波阿斯；波阿斯生俄备得；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;俄备得生耶西；耶西生大卫。</p>"
  }
]